      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to GET /simple/supported_vs_currencies rather than /ping, because ping is not a pinned upstream action.",
        "Pinned to the Pro host and x-cg-pro-api-key header; Demo api.coingecko.com / x-cg-demo-api-key is a separate edition and is not computed at request time.",
        "Returns the raw currency-id array under data rather than the upstream {currencies} wrapper.",
        "Native category is utility rather than finance: CoinGecko is market data, not payments or banking-data; Rust CATEGORIES has no finance bucket, and payments would misclassify a price/index API."
